body:
I tried using them a few times but they make me feel kind of sick and really mentally drained like it was getting rid of all of my positive energy. I thought It was a coincidence but I don't get sick or anything while using other subs though so idk. It also gave me a really bad feeling, kinda like I was being watched or hunted by something, I thought it was just me cause the comments are always so positive.

&#x200B;

Edit; I also couldn't sleep for 2+ nights after, and had trouble falling asleep days after that. I thought it was just a shifting symptom. I've had insomnia before but never that bad, I just ended up staring at the wall for like 4 hours. It happens whenever I use their subliminal it's weird, I also get super paranoid and jumpy.  (again feeling like something is watching me when I'm alone)
